Hello,

I have made a minor update to v0.58.0.

"NBS" now returns the t-statistics associated with edges in the connected components. Also, I changed a few arguments to "dti_create_mats". For all changes, please see the "NEWS.md" file (highlighted in green) at the Github diff page <https://github.com/cwatson/brainGraph/commit/043a2d9b2d124d75ecfb35b171e8cf57a18c1444?short_path=8312ad0#diff-8312ad0561ef661716b48d09478362f3>.

The User Guide will be updated shortly to reflect code that will work.

Chris

